  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0151" xml:lang="en">
        <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00495/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
          <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_bronold" xml:lang="en">
            <opener>
              <seg hand="#print_black_oegfl">
                <orgName>
                  <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_9">ÖSTERREICHISCHE GESELLSCHAFT FÜR LITERATUR</rs>
                </orgName>
                  <lb/><placeName><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_177">PALAIS WILCZEK, 1010 WIEN I, HERRENGASSE 5</rs></placeName> TEL. 63 81 59, 63 08 64
              </seg>
              <dateline>  
                <date>
                  <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="24"/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_1">Vienna</rs>, September 24th, l973
                </date>
              </dateline>
              <salute>
                <lb/>Dear Mr. <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Auden</rs>,
              </salute>
            </opener>
            <p>
              <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="4"/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_137">Dr. Kraus</rs> is at present in <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_420">Istanbul</rs> on vacation.
              <lb/>I hope y<subst><del rend="erased" hand="#type_cc_bronold"><unclear>i</unclear></del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">o</add></subst>u have meanwhile received the printe<subst><del rend="erased" hand="#type_cc_bronold">s</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">d</add></subst> invitation
              <lb/>for <rs type="event" ref="#amp_event_id_3">the 28th</rs>. Gladly, we will send one of our assistants,
              <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_284">Mr. Urbach</rs>, to call on you at the <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_225">Altenburger Hof</rs> and walk
              <lb/>with you to the <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_351">Josefsplatz</rs>. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/>It takes five minutes to walk,
              <lb/>by car it would be at least fifteen. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/>I hope 7h45 is agree-
              <lb/>able to you.
            </p>
            <p>
              <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="5"/>According to <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_137">Dr. Kraus</rs>' wishes I have selected the
              <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ana="#ana_111">poems to be read by <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_129">Mr. Benning</rs></rs>, and he will need about 35
              <lb/>to 40 minutes. <space unit="char" quantity="1"/>We would be very glad if you <subst><del rend="erased" hand="#type_cc_bronold"><unclear>w</unclear></del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">c</add></subst>ould <subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_cc_bronold">chos</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_cc_bronold">read</add></subst><unclear><del rend="erased" hand="#type_cc_bronold">e</del></unclear>
              <lb/>for l5 to 20 minutes, so that the whole program lasts for
              <lb/>about one hour.
            </p>
            <closer>
              <salute>
                <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="5"/>With best regards,
              </salute>
              <salute>
                <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="30"/>Sincerly yours,
              </salute>
              <signed hand="#hand_blue_bronold">
                <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_135">Hella Bronold</rs>
              </signed>
              <signed hand="#type_black_bronold">
                <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="29"/>(<rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_135">Hella Bronold</rs>)
              </signed>            
            </closer>
          </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00496/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
          <div>
            <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0151">
              63a
            </ab>
          </div>
      </div>
